# Rust Clippy (tvscreener-rs)

## Forbidden allows

- **`#[allow(clippy::too_many_arguments)]` is forbidden.**
- **`#[allow(clippy::too_many_lines)]` is forbidden.**
- **`#[allow(dead_code)]` is forbidden.** Use the item (real path or test) or remove it.

## How to fix instead

- **`too_many_arguments`:** pass a struct / config / context, or split the function.
- **`too_many_lines`:** extract private helpers in the same module.
- **`dead_code`:** wire the item or delete it.

## Lint bar

`make lint` / `make clippy` deny: `-D warnings -D clippy::all -D clippy::pedantic -D clippy::nursery`.
